# AC-119 — the frozen V1 regression baseline is not a formatting target.
#
# `v1.1-acceptance.md` § 2 requires `v1-canonical-run.json` to remain
# **byte-identical**, and every V1.1 rung closure re-verifies that. It was
# nevertheless in Prettier's dirty list, which made the documented remedy
# for a failing `pnpm format` -- namely `pnpm format:write` -- a command
# that would silently rewrite the baseline (measured: 64,759 -> 64,094
# bytes) and break a mission stop condition.
#
# Excluding it removes the hazard at its source rather than relying on
# nobody running the obvious fix.
